OL,3,GNEWSAThird man charged over Raise the
OL,4,AColours flags disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third man has been charged after
OL,7,Fdisorder broke out in Birmingham as
OL,8,Fcampaign group Raise the Colours
OL,9,Fattempted to attach St George's flags
OL,10,Fto lamp-posts.
OL,12,FJulian Keane, aged 53 of Sutton
OL,13,FColdfield, was charged on Monday with
OL,14,Fcausing serious injury by dangerous
OL,15,Fdriving. He was released on bail to
OL,16,Fappear before city magistrates on 16
OL,17,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
