OL,3,GNEWSAThird man charged over Raise the
OL,4,AColours flags disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt relates to an incident involving a
OL,7,FFord Transit on Mayfield Road on 14
OL,8,FMay, when a pedestrian was hit by a van
OL,9,Fand taken to hospital with leg
OL,10,Finjuries.
OL,12,FThe van was recovered nearby shortly
OL,13,Fafterwards, and police have been
OL,14,Fcarrying out inquiries to establish the
OL,15,Ffull circumstances around what
OL,16,Fhappened.
